  "title": "Oozumou Reijou ~Seijo ni Hirateuchi wo Kuratta Shunkan Sumou Budatta Zense wo Omoidashita Akuyaku Reijou no Watashi wa sute Neko Ouji ni Chanko wo Furumaitai Haadosukoidosukoi~",
  "original_title": "Oozumou Reijou ~Seijo ni Hirateuchi wo Kuratta Shunkan Sumou Budatta Zense wo Omoidashita Akuyaku Reijou no Watashi wa sute Neko Ouji ni Chanko wo Furumaitai Haadosukoidosukoi~",
  "alt_titles": [
    "大相撲令嬢　～聖女に平手打ちを食らった瞬間相撲部だった前世を思い出した悪役令嬢の私は捨て猫王子にちゃんこを振る舞いたい　はぁどすこいどすこい～",
    "大相撲令嬢",
    "Oozumou Reijou"
  ],
  "description": "(from: Mangaupdates)\n\nThe past life of the otome game's villainess was a sumo wrestler!?\n\nFlorche, whose engagement with the prince was annulled after she was falsely accused of a crime, recovers the memories of her previous life as a member of a women's sumo club after being slapped by the local saintess.\n\nShe also realizes that this world is exactly the same as the setting of the otome game she played in her past life.\n\nAs a lone sumo wrestler, she cannot forgive such injustice! What she may lack physical strength, she makes up with her sumo spirit!\n\nWith her slaps and sumo stances, she knocks down the handsome capture targets from the beloved otome game!\n\nShe will protect her favorite second prince and save the kingdom!!",
